<title>USA: US corn gluten values unchanged, trade moderate.</title>
<headline>US corn gluten values unchanged, trade moderate.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten product prices were unchanged Friday in moderate trading, cash sources said. &quot;We haven't had any problems selling these numbers, one Illinois dealer said.</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq	 unq</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -  100.00    100.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     April    -  345.00    345.00</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -   89.00     89.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  345.00    345.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
